== one unscoped map shared by every tenant ==
acme sees:   Refund approved for PERSON_001, SSN US_SSN_001.
globex sees: Chargeback opened for PERSON_002, SSN US_SSN_002.
globex's agent reveals acme's token: Maria Garcia 900-45-1122

== scope = tenant ==
acme sees:   Refund approved for PERSON_001, SSN US_SSN_001.
globex sees: Chargeback opened for PERSON_001, SSN US_SSN_001.  <- same token text, different tenant
globex reveals PERSON_001: John Smith
acme reveals PERSON_001:   Maria Garcia
audit: [('tenant:globex', 'revealed'), ('tenant:acme', 'revealed')]

Note: the token strings collide across tenants by design. Safety
comes from the scope on every lookup, so a token copied into the
wrong tenant's context resolves to that tenant's own record or to
nothing. Never to the other tenant's.
